<h1 data-copy-en="Zoe" data-copy-zh="Zoe">Zoe</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Zoe’s computer-and-dojo sequence, conversation unlocks, gifts and seven dates." data-copy-zh="Zoe的计算机与道场序列、交谈解锁、礼物和七项约会。">Zoe’s computer-and-dojo sequence, conversation unlocks, gifts and seven dates.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Zoe</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Secret_Room_and_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All_Seven_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk.2C_Books_and_Teddy_Bears"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk,_Books_and_Teddy_Bears"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Zoe — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zoe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zoe — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zoe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zoe — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Zoe’s friendship route begins with a shared lab encounter, followed by four computer actions alternating with Master Lilu’s dojo events. Completing that sequence opens ordinary Talk and gifts; later dates use separate stage gates.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Zoe</h2><p>Find her at University Computer Lab, daily 09:00–17:00. Once Diane builds the Boardwalk, her separate portrait appears there daily 17:00–20:00.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">University Computer Lab</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Boardwalk built</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_Route:_Lab_and_Dojo_Visits_in_Order"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Complete Lab Rats with Rachel, learn System Hacking, and select the computer action at the lab. Then alternate the next computer action with the corresponding dojo event: Master Lilu must reach Acquaintance (50), Friend (100) and Crush (400) for the three dojo visits.</p><p>After the fourth computer event, Talk and gifts open. At Acquaintance (50), return for Coming Clean to unlock most personal dates. At Romantic (800), another lab milestone opens after that apology. The computer scenes are once-only story encounters, rather than ordinary repeatable heart-to-hearts.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Coming Clean</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">University Computer Lab; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zoe Acquaintance (50); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zoe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Through the Screen</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">University Computer Lab; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zoe Romantic (800); after Coming Clean</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zoe +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lab Rats</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">University Computer Lab; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Rachel Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe's First Lesson</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Dojo; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Master Lilu Acquaintance (50); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Master Lilu +3 / Zoe +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe's Second Wind</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Dojo; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Master Lilu Friend (100); after Zoe's First Lesson / Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Master Lilu +4 / Zoe +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe Stands Her Ground</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Dojo; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Master Lilu Crush (400); after Zoe's Second Wind / Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Master Lilu +5 / Zoe +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Zoo Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Coming Clean</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farmers Market Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Coming Clean</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; $40; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Picnic Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Coming Clean</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $30; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Comiccon Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Coming Clean</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $150; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Coming Clean; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 12:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardwalk; 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Restoring the Boardwalk / Coming Clean; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; $50; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Each computer action takes 20 minutes and 20 Calm and needs System Hacking. Its earlier dojo/computer prerequisites decide which of the identically named entries appears.</p><p>Lab Talk requires Known (25) and has four safe uses daily. Boardwalk Talk has three and does not require Known. Each takes 20 minutes for 1 base point. The two counters are separate. Teddy gives 8 and Book gives 10 base points for 10 minutes and one item, each twice daily after the fourth computer event.</p><p>There are seven one-time dates, with costs and windows below. Farmers Market effectively begins at 09:00 because of the lab portrait, and Voucher Fair ends at 17:00. At Crush (400), the later screen milestone also qualifies her for KTV/Night Club invitations, 20:00–23:00.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Technology 50 / Intelligence 50 / Charm 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Quantum Computing</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Zoe</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hack Zoe's Computer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); learn System Hacking; after Lab Rats</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hack Zoe's Computer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); learn System Hacking; after Hack Zoe's Computer / Zoe's First Lesson</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hack Zoe's Computer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); learn System Hacking; after Hack Zoe's Computer / Zoe's Second Wind</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hack Zoe's Computer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); learn System Hacking; after Hack Zoe's Computer / Zoe Stands Her Ground</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Teddy Bear</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Teddy ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +8; 2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Book</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Book ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +10; 2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Secret Room</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Computer Lab; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 1000; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Zoe</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardwalk; 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); after Hack Zoe's Computer</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Do not repeat a completed computer step to seek the next one: return to Lilu’s dojo and check his relationship stage. Boardwalk construction does not replace the fourth computer event. Zoe’s favored Quantum Computing skill is not a lesson she teaches.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="character-lilu.html">Master Lilu</a> · <a href="character-rachel.html">Rachel</a> · <a href="game-systems-kupie-love-training.html">Kupie’s Love Training</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Secret_Room_and_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All_Seven_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk.2C_Books_and_Teddy_Bears"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk,_Books_and_Teddy_Bears"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Zoe 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zoe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zoe 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zoe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zoe 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Zoe的关系路线从共同实验室事件开始，接着四次计算机动作与Master Lilu的道场事件交替进行。完成这套序列才开放普通交谈和礼物，后续约会再检查各自的关系阶段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>每天09:00—17:00可在大学计算机实验室见她。Diane建成木板路后，那里另有每天17:00—20:00的头像。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">大学计算机实验室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">木板路</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">木板路建成</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_Route:_Lab_and_Dojo_Visits_in_Order"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先完成Rachel参与的实验室事件，学会系统入侵，再在实验室选择计算机动作。随后依次交替下一次计算机动作和对应道场事件，三次道场拜访分别要求Master Lilu达到相识（50）、朋友（100）、迷恋（400）。</p><p>第四次计算机事件后开放交谈和礼物。Zoe达到相识（50）后，返回完成坦白从宽，才会开放多数个人约会；浪漫感（800）阶段则在道歉之后还有一项实验室里程碑。计算机事件是一次性故事事件，不是可重复的普通谈心。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">坦白从宽</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">大学计算机实验室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zoe 相识（50）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zoe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">隔着屏幕</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">大学计算机实验室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zoe 浪漫感（800）；完成：坦白从宽</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zoe +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">实验室小白鼠</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">大学计算机实验室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Rachel 相识（50）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe的第一课</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">道场; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Master Lilu 相识（50）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Master Lilu +3、Zoe +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe重振旗鼓</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">道场; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Master Lilu 朋友（100）；完成：Zoe的第一课、黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Master Lilu +4、Zoe +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zoe站稳了脚跟</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">道场; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Master Lilu 迷恋（400）；完成：Zoe重振旗鼓、黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Master Lilu +5、Zoe +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">动物园约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：坦白从宽</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−50 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农贸市场约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：坦白从宽</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；财富40；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">野餐约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：坦白从宽</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富30；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动漫展约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：坦白从宽</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180分钟；财富150；−60 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：坦白从宽；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富150；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 12:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">木板路; 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：重修海滨木栈道、坦白从宽；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；财富50；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>每次计算机动作消耗20分钟、20镇定，并要求系统入侵；同名条目由前一项道场与计算机事件决定何时出现。</p><p>实验室交谈要求已知（25），每日安全额度4次；木板路交谈不要求已知，每日3次。两者各耗20分钟、获得1点基础关系，并分别计数。第四次计算机事件后，泰迪熊给予8点、书本10点基础关系，各消耗10分钟和一份物品，各自每日2次。</p><p>共有七项一次性约会，消耗与时段见下表。农贸市场受实验室头像限制，实际从09:00开始；兑换券游园会则到17:00结束。达到迷恋（400），并完成后期屏幕事件后，也可在20:00—23:00从KTV或夜总会邀约。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">科技 50、智力 50、魅力 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">量子计算</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Zoe 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">入侵Zoe的电脑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；学会系统黑客；完成：实验室小白鼠</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟；−20 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">入侵Zoe的电脑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；学会系统黑客；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑、Zoe的第一课</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟；−20 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">入侵Zoe的电脑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；学会系统黑客；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑、Zoe重振旗鼓</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟；−20 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">入侵Zoe的电脑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；学会系统黑客；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑、Zoe站稳了脚跟</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟；−20 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送泰迪熊</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；泰迪熊 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+8；2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送书</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；书 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+10；2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">密室</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学计算机实验室; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数1000；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Zoe 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">木板路; 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；完成：黑进Zoe的电脑</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；3次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>想推进下一步时，不必重复已完成的计算机事件，请返回Lilu道场并检查他的关系阶段。木板路建造也不能代替第四次计算机事件。Zoe偏好的量子计算并不是她提供的教学。</p></section>
